===Etymology===
{{etymon|en|id=nonacademic periodical|:inh|enm:magasyne|tree=1}}
From {{inh|en|enm|magasyne}}, from {{der|en|frm|magasin||warehouse, store}}, from {{der|en|it|magazzino||storehouse}}, ultimately from {{der|en|ar|مَخَازِن|g=p}}, plural of {{m|ar|مَخْزَن||storeroom, storehouse}}, [[noun of place]] from {{m|ar|خَزَنَ||to store, to stock, to lay up}}. {{etydate|1580s|ref={{R:Etymonline|pos=n}}}}. {{root|en|ar|خ ز ن}}

